    "detailed_description": "<i>Kaila: The Journey to the Underworld</i> is a 2D action-adventure platformer in the metroidvania style, featuring beautiful pixel art graphics, a dark and mysterious atmosphere, and a vast medieval fantasy world.<br><br>Embark on Kaila's journey, a young girl determined to rescue her mother, who has been taken by Graygar, the Grey Soul. To succeed, she must explore a world full of secrets, dangers, and magical creatures, overcoming ever-increasing challenges while developing new skills and powers.<br><br>Unravel mysteries, interact with intriguing NPCs, defeat relentless enemies, and face challenging bosses as you venture deeper into the Underworld, the domain of Graygar and Death itself.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3469050/extras/cc67e1738a15f664d80622825780af2b.avif?t=1755127360\" data-has-big width=800 height=250 /></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Game Features:</strong></h2><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Non-linear exploration in a vast medieval fantasy world.<br></li><li>Dynamic combat and skill progression.<br></li><li>Engaging NPC encounters offering quests, secrets, and upgrades.<br></li><li>Epic bosses with unique attack patterns.<br></li><li>Detailed pixel art with stunning, dark, and mystical environments.<br></li><li>Precise and responsive controls \u2013 attack, dodge, and unleash powerful magic to defeat your enemies.</li></ul><br>Can Kaila defy fate and bring her mother back?<br><br>Get ready for an exciting and challenging journey into the Underworld!<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3469050/extras/d27bffc5b048d2ab80d73f6f1f7d4db9.avif?t=1755127360\" data-has-big width=800 height=250 /></span><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3469050/extras/9a8c544d989722fd0fcad414675d01e4.avif?t=1755127360\" data-has-big width=800 height=250 /></span><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3469050/extras/387aac89aafd5d7852ba684e20967ed9.avif?t=1755127360\" data-has-big width=800 height=148 /></span><br><br>Add it to your wishlist!",
    "about_the_game": "<i>Kaila: The Journey to the Underworld</i> is a 2D action-adventure platformer in the metroidvania style, featuring beautiful pixel art graphics, a dark and mysterious atmosphere, and a vast medieval fantasy world.<br><br>Embark on Kaila's journey, a young girl determined to rescue her mother, who has been taken by Graygar, the Grey Soul. To succeed, she must explore a world full of secrets, dangers, and magical creatures, overcoming ever-increasing challenges while developing new skills and powers.<br><br>Unravel mysteries, interact with intriguing NPCs, defeat relentless enemies, and face challenging bosses as you venture deeper into the Underworld, the domain of Graygar and Death itself.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3469050/extras/cc67e1738a15f664d80622825780af2b.avif?t=1755127360\" data-has-big width=800 height=250 /></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Game Features:</strong></h2><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Non-linear exploration in a vast medieval fantasy world.<br></li><li>Dynamic combat and skill progression.<br></li><li>Engaging NPC encounters offering quests, secrets, and upgrades.<br></li><li>Epic bosses with unique attack patterns.<br></li><li>Detailed pixel art with stunning, dark, and mystical environments.<br></li><li>Precise and responsive controls \u2013 attack, dodge, and unleash powerful magic to defeat your enemies.</li></ul><br>Can Kaila defy fate and bring her mother back?<br><br>Get ready for an exciting and challenging journey into the Underworld!<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3469050/extras/d27bffc5b048d2ab80d73f6f1f7d4db9.avif?t=1755127360\" data-has-big width=800 height=250 /></span><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3469050/extras/9a8c544d989722fd0fcad414675d01e4.avif?t=1755127360\" data-has-big width=800 height=250 /></span><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3469050/extras/387aac89aafd5d7852ba684e20967ed9.avif?t=1755127360\" data-has-big width=800 height=148 /></span><br><br>Add it to your wishlist!",
